[46.922419, "o", "The last 30 lines of logs from the \u001b[1;36;40mbackend-api\u001b[0m deployment in the \u001b[1;36;40mstaging\u001b[0m namespace indicate the following issue:                                                                                                                                        \r\n\r\n\u001b[1;35mPod: \u001b[0m\u001b[1;36;40mbackend-api-6f64dfcd85-95mfg\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                                                                                                       \r\n\r\n\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m \u001b[0m\u001b[38;2;248;248;242;48;2;39;40;34mERROR: database connection refused\u001b[0m\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \u001b[0m\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;35mPod: \u001b[0m\u001b[1;36;40mbackend-api-6f64dfcd85-wz22p\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                                                                                                       \r\n\r\n\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m \u001b[0m\u001b[38;2;248;248;242;48;2;39;40;34mERROR: database connection refused\u001b[0m\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \u001b[0m\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \u001b[0m\r\n\r\nBoth pods are reporting a \"database connection refused\" error. This suggests that the backend API is unable to connect to its database.                                                                                                                 \r\n\r\nWould you like me to check if the database service exists and is reachable from the \u001b[1;36;40mstaging\u001b[0m namespace?The last 30 lines of logs from the \u001b[1;36;40mbackend-api\u001b[0m deployment in the \u001b[1;36;40mstaging\u001b[0m namespace indicate the following issue:                                  \r\n\r\n\u001b[1;35mPod: \u001b[0m\u001b[1;36;40mbackend-api-6f64dfcd85-95mfg\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                                                                                                       \r\n\r\n\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m \u001b[0m\u001b[38;2;248;248;242;48;2;39;40;34mERROR: database connection refused\u001b[0m\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \u001b[0m\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m                           "]
[46.922613, "o", "                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;35mPod: \u001b[0m\u001b[1;36;40mbackend-api-6f64dfcd85-wz22p\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                                                                                                       \r\n\r\n\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m \u001b[0m\u001b[38;2;248;248;242;48;2;39;40;34mERROR: database connection refused\u001b[0m\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \u001b[0m\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[48;2;39;40;34m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \u001b[0m\r\n\r\nBoth pods are reporting a \"database connection refused\" error. This suggests that the backend API is unable to connect to its database.                                                                                                                 \r\n\r\nWould you like me to check if the database service exists and is reachable from the \u001b[1;36;40mstaging\u001b[0m namespace?                                                                                                      